  "notes": "The character the human controls: the D-pad walks in 8 directions and every weapon fires on its own. Starts with the Magic Bolt and 5 hearts (more with Vitality / Hollow Heart). Weapons are off until their level variable is 1 or more; the level-up menu raises them. Evolved weapons replace their base weapon.",
